@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Gateway's own health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### UserService health through the gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/user

### AdminService health through the gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/admin

### PropertyService health through the gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/property

### NotificationService health (notification requests themselves use RabbitMQ)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/notification

### Admin roles (requires admin.roles.manage in the JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/roles?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Uniform service prefix: /services/{service-id}/{downstream-path}
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/user/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Development OpenAPI document used by gateway Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/user/swagger.json
